!Name: p72sidelwss
!C A period 72 c/3 sideways LWSS rake.
!C This uses two period 72 forward rakes and a period 9 convoy which
!C converts gliders into a "big spark" like the one produced by the
!C period 46 shuttle.  Each big spark converts a glider into a LWSS.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
